OL,3,GNEWSANI risks missing 2030 energy
OL,4,Agoals, says Stormont committee
OL,5,
OL,6,FTime is running out to meet key targets
OL,7,Fwithin Stormont's energy strategy by
OL,8,F2030, a committee has said.
OL,10,FThe Public Accounts Committee (PAC)
OL,11,Freport followed an inquiry into the
OL,12,FDepartment for the Economy's (DfE)
OL,13,Fdelivery of the net zero strategy.
OL,15,FThe PAC heard that Northern Ireland
OL,16,Fcould lose out on significant economic
OL,17,Fopportunities if action was not speeded
OL,18,Fup.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
