OL,3,GNEWSANI risks missing 2030 energy
OL,4,Agoals, says Stormont committee
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee chair Daniel McCrossan said
OL,7,Fthe government had a "responsibility to
OL,8,Fcreate the conditions needed for
OL,9,Finvestment to proceed, otherwise there
OL,10,Fis a real risk it will go elsewhere".
